ing)`\" shape recurs in both `ValidateUniqueIdentity` and `PossibleDuplicate` \u2014 but their semantics differ (throw-on-match vs. skip-match-while-seeking-soft-match), so inlining each is the reasonable call rather than forcing a shared helper."
